# Paul
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Five rounds of double-unders, knees-to-elbows and a heavy overhead walk.
note: The overhead walk is 20 yards with a barbell. The original posting gives men's loads only; the women's loads are the commonly used ones.
5 rounds for time
  50 Double-under
  35 Knees-to-elbow
  60 ft Overhead carry 185/125 lb
